owerhouse Dynamics / Middleby","location":"U.S. (remotely)","from":"2025-12-01","until":"2040-12-18","body":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Operating as a core integrations engineer for a B2B enterprise "},{"type":"text","text":"IoT ","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":"platform managing automated commercial kitchen appliances. Tasked with "},{"type":"text","text":"reverse-engineering","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"text","text":"scaling","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"text","text":"maintaining ","underline":true},{"type":"text","text":"a massive, custom PHP codebase to successfully "},{"type":"text","text":"onboard new enterprise clients","underline":true},{"type":"text","text":" and their proprietary hardware."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Key Achievements:","underline":true}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Guaranteed flawless"},{"type":"text","text":" bi-directional","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" communication, from parsing incoming telemetry to safely executing over-the-air "},{"type":"text","text":"(OTA) firmware updates","bold":true}]}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Navigated and integrated features into a "},{"type":"text","text":"highly complex","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"text","text":"framework-less","underline":true},{"type":"text","text":" PHP environment containing "},{"type":"text","text":"16,000+ line files","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Actively monitored logs, "},{"type":"text","text":"tracked performance metrics","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":", and conducted rigorous "},{"type":"text","text":"impact analyses","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" to ensure enterprise-grade stability during new device integrations."}]}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Dynamically updated schemas across a "},{"type":"text","text":"multi-database ecosystem","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" to expand complex data architectures and catalog intricate"},{"type":"text","text":" IoT device metadata","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"popover":null,"highlighted_text_color":"primary","font_size":null,"line_height":null,"text_align":null,"color":"#eeeeee"},{"id":6,"component_id":"cv, work experience, gl","title":"Fullstack Integration Specialist","orientation":"Backend oriented","company":"GlobalLogic","client":"Verizon","location":"U.S.","from":"2023-10-13","until":"2025-12-01","body":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Operated as an "},{"type":"text","text":"Acting Tech Lead","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" and primary technical "},{"type":"text","text":"bridge","underline":true},{"type":"text","text":" for an enterprise-scale API Marketplace built for "},{"type":"text","text":"Verizon","bold":true,"underline":true},{"type":"text","text":", one of the largest telecommunications companies in the U.S. Thriving in a highly "},{"type":"text","text":"fast-paced environment","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" I guided a massive cross-functional team while navigating a complex monorepo architecture utilizing Next.js, TypeScript, and a dual-backend system designed to separate heavy data processing from secondary documentation tasks."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Key achievements:","underline":true}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Spearheaded ","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":"the end-to-end "},{"type":"text","text":"creation ","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":"of a new Single Sign-On "},{"type":"text","text":"(SSO) solution","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" across the entire platform, replacing a legacy system that was unsafe and difficult to integrate. The new architecture enabled seamless authentication across 5 distinct frontend apps (2 producer, 3 consumer) and the dual-backend system."}]}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Stepped up to"},{"type":"text","text":" lead coordination","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" across a massive team of Frontend, Backend, UX/UI, and DevOps engineers, ensuring rapid, "},{"type":"text","text":"high-quality","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" feature delivery aligned with "},{"type":"text","text":"Verizon's strict","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deadlines","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":""}]}],"popover":null,"highlighted_text_color":"primary","font_size":null,"line_height":null,"text_align":"left","color":"#eeeeee"},{"id":5,"component_id":"cv, work experience section, finalis","title":"Frontend Architectural Consultant","orientation":null,"company":"Finalis","client":null,"location":"U.S.","from":"2023-12-01","until":"2024-04-19","body":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Acted as an external "},{"type":"text","text":"technical consultant","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" for an established US-based "},{"type":"text","text":"fintech","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":", coordinating the Frontend team through a major infrastructure overhaul and guided the transition of a critical "},{"type":"text","text":"consumer-facing application","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" during the large scale migration from an REST API infrastructure into a modern "},{"type":"text","text":"Next.js + GraphQL environment","underline":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Key achievements:","underline":true}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Orchestrated the Frontend integration strategy to transition the consumer-facing app away from a legacy REST API and into a modern "},{"type":"text","text":"GraphQL-based architecture","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Designed the application's foundational boilerplate and file structure utilizing "},{"type":"text","text":"Clean Architecture","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":", while integrating "},{"type":"text","text":"SOLID ","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":"principles to ensure "},{"type":"text","text":"high maintainability","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" and scalability.  "}]}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Led sprint planning","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":", task estimations, and Frontend-Backend integration roadmaps, "},{"type":"text","text":"successfully delivering","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" the project's critical initial phases."}]}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Established "},{"type":"text","text":"strict development standards","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" from the ground up, utilizing tools like ESLint and Prettier to enforce clean, production-ready code quality."}]}]}],"popover":null,"highlighted_text_color":"primary","font_size":null,"line_height":null,"text_align":"left","color":"#eeeeee"},{"id":7,"component_id":"cv, work experience, biwini","title":"Senior Fullstack Developer","orientation":"Backend oriented","company":"Biwini","client":"Government Agency","location":"Argentina","from":"2023-04-01","until":"2023-10-13","body":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Operated as a "},{"type":"text","text":"client-facing","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" Fullstack Developer at an Argentine software factory, spearheading the "},{"type":"text","text":"technical delivery","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" of a "},{"type":"text","text":"highly secure","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" government platform. Engineered three robust PHP/Laravel applications designed to digitize "},{"type":"text","text":"public infrastructure","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" and building paperwork for local citizens."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Key achievements:","underline":true}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Led direct client consultations","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" to gather complex municipal requirements, translating acceptance criteria into actionable technical architectures, cross-team sprint plans, and time estimations."}]}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Architected a strict "},{"type":"text","text":"security-first environment","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" with robust protections against SQL injections, endpoint scraping, and unauthorized access, effectively "},{"type":"text","text":"securing communications","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" between the "},{"type":"text","text":"Frontend and Backend","underline":true},{"type":"text","text":" via Laravel's built-in REST API methods.  "}]}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Engineered "},{"type":"text","text":"intelligent file-handling pipelines","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" that "},{"type":"text","text":"actively scanned","underline":true},{"type":"text","text":" user uploads for malicious code before compressing them to "},{"type":"text","text":"maximize efficiency","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" and optimize storage on the municipality's "},{"type":"text","text":"custom bare-metal servers.","underline":true}]}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully balanced development across multiple Frontend paradigms, managing both a Laravel Blade/jQuery environment and an AngularJS application."}]}]}],"popover":null,"highlighted_text_color":"primary","font_size":null,"line_height":null,"text_align":"left","color":"#eeeeee"},{"id":8,"component_id":"cv, work experience, tsumugi hotel","title":"Part-time Frontend Developer","orientation":null,"company":"Tsumugi Hotel","client":null,"location":"Japan","from":"2022-04-04","until":"2023-03-17","body":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Engaged in a "},{"type":"text","text":"part-time Frontend","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" capacity while studying the Japanese language "},{"type":"text","text":"abroad in Japan","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":", contributing to the web development team of a prestigious hotel in Kyoto. Assisted in a major technical migration to "},{"type":"text","text":"modernize","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" a "},{"type":"text","text":"critical customer-facing application","underline":true},{"type":"text","text":".  "}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Key Achievements:","underline":true}]},{"type":"list","format":"unordered","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Executed the step-by-step migration of a "},{"type":"text","text":"legacy React.js","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" application into a "},{"type":"text","text":"modern Next.js","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"text","text":"TypeScript","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" environment, systematically updating old class-based components to modern functional hooks utilizing server-side rendering. "}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Acted as a technical bridge by "},{"type":"text","text":"translating complex project documentation","underline":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from Japanese to English","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":", lowering the barrier to entry for the codebase and "},{"type":"text","text":"ensuring clear communication","underline":true},{"type":"text","text":" across the team.  "}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Assisted the broader engineering team in "},{"type":"text","text":"restructuring","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":" the project's internal architecture to align with Clean Architecture principles, gaining "},{"type":"text","text":"critical early exposure","underline":true},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"type":"text","text":"scalable ","bold":true},{"type":"text","text":"enterprise design patterns. "}]}]}],"popover":null,"highlighted_text_color":"primary","font_size":null,"line_height":null,"text_align":"left","color":"#eeeeee"}],"__component":"sections.work-experience-section"},{"id":3,"component_id":"cv, projects section","title":"My side projects","title_color":"#eeeeee","link_to_page":null,"projects":[{"id":11,"component_id":"cv, projects, ubw","title":"Unlimited Blades Work","highlighted_subtitle":"Netflix at home","popover":null,"disable_primary_link":false,"icon":null,"links":[{"id":29,"component_id":"cv, projects, ubw, links, link to blog","title":"View it on my blog","label":"View it on my blog","href":"/blog/unlimited-blades-work","popover":null,"variant":"link","target":"_self","color":"primary","size":"caption","icon":null},{"id":37,"component_id":"cv page, projects, ubw, link a github","title":"Github","label":"View it on GitHub","href":"https://github.com/TheMrCorvy/chaldea-foundation","popover":null,"variant":"link","target":"_blank","color":"primary","size":"caption","icon":null},{"id":38,"component_id":"cv page, projects, ubw, view it live link","title":"View it live","label":"View it live","href":"https://unlimitedblades.work","popover":null,"variant":"link","target":"_blank","color":"primary","size":"captio